    "updated_at": "2025-08-11T15:14:13Z",
    "body": "The reason this is the way it is is that for web compat, `fieldset` generally needs to force `display`. \nSee https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3915\n\nIt's possible that we could make some exceptions, e.g. specifying subgrid could opt out of the anonymous fieldset content box. Or some other explicit opt-out, see https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3912",
